#Palette Name: Colorboy
#Description: A Gameboy Color inspired palette designed for linear ramps of 4 colors that include black and white. There are 8 base colors and 6 shadow colors, many of which can be mixed to create subtle variations for each base color. Not really designed for larger mixed ramps.
